{"id":"dick-grant","n":"Dick Grant","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_dick_grant.jpg","bio":"Dick Grant worked as a wellsite geologist in Wichita, Kansas. After becoming a Christian, he spent his free time between logging well samples reading the Bible. Jim Morris, another geologist, challenged Dick to saturate his life with the Word of God through scripture memory. He soon began leading small groups through Moody Bible’s Memorize the Word course written by Dawson Trotman and Lorne Sanny. He and his wife Judy multiplied disciples throughout the United States, and around the world.","queue":["27495","27016","25212","17683","18851","17684","19121"],"talks":{"27495":{"t":"Being a Loser for Christ","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Christ Our Life","Discipleship"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/NET00756.mp3","lk":3},"27016":{"t":"Man-to-Man","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Man-to-Man","Discipleship"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/M184.mp3","lk":25,"pdf":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/PDFs/JimMorrisNavLog.pdf"},"25212":{"t":"Man-to-Man - Mission, Method, and Motive","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Man-to-Man","Discipleship"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/K142.mp3","lk":23,"pdf":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/PDFs/JimMorrisNavLog.pdf"},"17683":{"t":"Quiet Time","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Quiet Time","Devotional Life"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/B245.mp3","lk":0},"18851":{"t":"Scripture Memory","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Scripture Memory","Word Hand Illustration"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/C271A.mp3","lk":5},"17684":{"t":"Time Alone with God","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Quiet Time","Devotional Life"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/B247.mp3","lk":0},"19121":{"t":"Witness Everywhere","sp":"dick-grant","tp":["Witnessing","World Vision"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/D019C.mp3","lk":30}}}